  "content": "<h2>是否曾覺得原版蘑菇看起來過於單調乏味？這個資源包旨在徹底重新設計蘑菇的物品圖示，並在放置時賦予它們自訂模型，解決這個問題！</h2><p><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/49488b3a21a8e9fc52ca183b6ef94ca0.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/a87ce425ac4f43f6e3ec24ca5de435c2.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/20083c2bc2fc6ac76651707e45949ae0.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.gyazo.com/f3e8e604382bafed197d20a808bbea7e.png&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"圖片\"></p><h3>此迷你資源包的內容來自我正在開發的一個更大專案，名為 <span style=\"color:#00e4ff\"><strong><a style=\"color:#00e4ff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252frappenems-reforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rappenem's Reforge</a>&nbsp;</strong></span>，該專案的目標是以這種風格重新繪製整個遊戲。因此，如果您喜歡這裡展示的像素藝術，不妨去看看，並在 <span style=\"color:#ff49fa\"><strong>&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#ff49fa\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/Rappenem\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></strong></span> 上支持我，即可獲得搶先體驗以及額外內容！</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Rappenem\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fe2313e6ca2c3df47d179aa09bbc4c57799f6094.png\" alt=\"FF\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252f2hvKFfPzQt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/95be1badf0f5131587308606c53801d55223882c.png\" alt=\"D\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252frappenems_reforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/77276c296d994e962ff04b57a57206c7abf516de.png\" alt=\"F\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fRapps_Reforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/24c2ce58d5be6a91a8fb4e14aee09b885f105ad5.png\" alt=\"H\"></a></p>",
